          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Soul Feeding"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, death, divine, manipulate)\n\nRequirements: The shroudwing is adjacent to a dying creature\n\nThe shroudwing attempts to devour the dying creature's soul. The creature must attempt a DC 18 Will save or their dying condition increases by 1 and the shroudwing regains 2d8 Hit Points."
